WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.955 --> 00:00:05.175
(screams)

00:00:05.175 --> 00:00:10.022
(Russian accordion music)

00:00:19.784 --> 00:00:22.337
- It doesn't smell terrible,
but it looks weird as hell.

00:00:22.337 --> 00:00:25.379
- It definitely smells kinda coleslaw-y.

00:00:25.379 --> 00:00:28.075
- Oh no!
(laughs)

00:00:29.986 --> 00:00:32.151
- It's like fish with
purple mayonnaise on top.

00:00:32.151 --> 00:00:33.491
- It tastes like the ocean.

00:00:33.491 --> 00:00:34.637
- I'm into this.

00:00:34.637 --> 00:00:36.645
- It has a very dirt-like aftertaste.

00:00:36.645 --> 00:00:38.965
Which I like dirt, I ate dirt growing up.

00:00:38.965 --> 00:00:40.207
- The Russians go to space.

00:00:40.207 --> 00:00:42.488
I wonder if they make the
astronauts eat that (beep).

00:00:49.070 --> 00:00:51.050
Smells normal, smells bologna-ish.

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.788
- This is the color of the zombies

00:00:53.788 --> 00:00:54.715
on &lt;i&gt;The Walking Dead&lt;i/&gt;.

00:00:54.715 --> 00:00:56.062
- I've never had bologna.

00:00:56.062 --> 00:00:57.321
(hums)

00:00:57.321 --> 00:00:58.179
- I've had bologna.

00:00:58.179 --> 00:01:00.606
- I'd say this tastes like
purchasing a Dell computer,

00:01:00.606 --> 00:01:01.686
just no joy.

00:01:01.686 --> 00:01:03.080
- It doesn't really taste like anything.

00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:04.515
- I actually like it to be honest.

00:01:04.515 --> 00:01:07.777
- Natasha, can I have your bologna?

00:01:07.777 --> 00:01:11.744
- No, only if you give me
your fish covered in beets.

00:01:16.573 --> 00:01:18.491
- Oh, that's so pickled.

00:01:18.491 --> 00:01:20.340
- This is tough, this is so hard.

00:01:20.340 --> 00:01:21.898
- It's so wet.

00:01:21.898 --> 00:01:22.743
- Thanks.

00:01:25.435 --> 00:01:29.040
- Oh, that's a lot of flavor, wow.

00:01:29.040 --> 00:01:31.649
- The garlicky-ness of it
helped me get through it.

00:01:31.649 --> 00:01:34.602
- This tastes like someone
threw acid on my grandmother.

00:01:34.602 --> 00:01:36.551
- I would blend that and drink it.

00:01:36.551 --> 00:01:37.713
- I like it so much!

00:01:37.713 --> 00:01:38.743
- You are wrong.

00:01:48.658 --> 00:01:51.503
- (laughs) Look at it jiggle.

00:01:51.503 --> 00:01:53.655
- The meat smells good, but why?

00:01:53.655 --> 00:01:54.998
- I don't know if I can do this.

00:01:57.550 --> 00:01:58.647
- Uh-uh.

00:01:58.647 --> 00:01:59.886
- The taste is fine.

00:01:59.886 --> 00:02:03.400
It tastes like chicken pot pie,
whatever, it's the texture.

00:02:03.400 --> 00:02:05.281
- Oh my God, this is so gross.

00:02:05.281 --> 00:02:06.125
- You brought us &lt;i&gt;Tetris&lt;/i&gt;,

00:02:06.125 --> 00:02:09.260
but you also brought us this,
so we're kinda back at zero.

00:02:09.260 --> 00:02:10.395
- This is what you
would eat at the Capitol

00:02:10.395 --> 00:02:11.730
of &lt;i&gt;The Hunger Games&lt;/i&gt;.

00:02:11.730 --> 00:02:13.478
(screams)

00:02:20.956 --> 00:02:22.170
- Wait a second.
- [Woman] What?

00:02:22.170 --> 00:02:22.931
- This is really, really weird.

00:02:22.931 --> 00:02:24.848
I'm not getting any smell at all.

00:02:24.848 --> 00:02:27.165
- Why must you do this to me?

00:02:27.165 --> 00:02:29.348
- This is already going horribly wrong.

00:02:29.348 --> 00:02:31.647
(indistinct talking)

00:02:31.647 --> 00:02:33.029
- It's so tough.

00:02:33.029 --> 00:02:34.386
- It's so salty.

00:02:34.386 --> 00:02:36.336
- All right, you're gonna kill me.

00:02:36.336 --> 00:02:37.355
I think I'm into it.

00:02:37.355 --> 00:02:39.236
- If I had to choose between
the meat Jello and this,

00:02:39.236 --> 00:02:40.494
I would take 20 of these.

00:02:40.494 --> 00:02:41.657
- As far as meat-related items,

00:02:41.657 --> 00:02:42.999
this might be the best maybe.

00:02:42.999 --> 00:02:45.221
- I would say this is probably

00:02:45.221 --> 00:02:47.826
the best thing that we've had today.

00:02:47.826 --> 00:02:50.575
- Thumbs up, A+.

00:02:50.575 --> 00:02:51.840
More pickled tomatoes.

00:02:51.840 --> 00:02:54.224
We need more pickled
tomatoes in our lives.

00:02:54.224 --> 00:02:55.172
We really do.

00:02:55.172 --> 00:02:55.907
- [Man In Hat] We need
to get more creative

00:02:55.907 --> 00:02:56.871
with our pickling in general.

00:02:56.871 --> 00:02:58.069
- I don't know why we
don't pickle everything.

00:02:58.069 --> 00:03:00.000
I love pickling.

